WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.376
Commuting by train. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:05.376 --> 00:00:12.768
The platform board shows the train time and platform. We check it, not the clock.

3
00:00:12.768 --> 00:00:21.480
Some coaches are quiet coaches. They are marked. Less talking, less noise.

4
00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:26.496
A seat facing the wall has fewer people walking past.

5
00:00:26.496 --> 00:00:33.168
Delay announcements happen. They are normal, not an emergency.

6
00:00:33.168 --> 00:00:39.096
We can put earphones in with no music: they work as earplugs.

7
00:00:39.096 --> 00:00:43.728
We get off at our stop, same time every day.

8
00:00:43.728 --> 00:00:48.168
The route becomes automatic after a week.

9
00:00:48.168 --> 00:00:56.376
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

